# No Mac reinstall after publish or lockfile scripts

`sync-develop-to-staging.sh`, `sync-staging-to-main.sh`, `update-lockfile-linux.sh`, and
`bump-version.sh` run npm in a temporary directory. They do not switch branches in this checkout
and they do not change host `node_modules` or `apps/mobile/node_modules`. Do not add a reinstall
step after them.

A command that bind-mounts this repo into a Linux container and runs `npm ci` or `npm install`
still replaces host `node_modules`. That command needs a **Root** reinstall once Docker has exited:

```bash
rm -rf node_modules && npm install
```
